OL,3,GNEWSANHS psychiatrist swaps consulting
OL,4,Aroom for cinema
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS psychiatrist who taught herself
OL,7,Ffilmmaking is bringing her first cinema
OL,8,Frelease to her home city.
OL,10,FDr Parvinder Shergill's film Touche,
OL,11,Fwhich explores mental health through
OL,12,Fthe sport of fencing, will be screened
OL,13,Fat Coventry's Odeon on Friday.
OL,15,FThe Coventry-born consultant
OL,16,Fpsychiatrist, who works in London,
OL,17,Fwrote and directed the film and stars
OL,18,Falongside Matthew Lewis, Nina Wadia and
OL,19,FPaul Chowdhry, with Sir Stephen Fry
OL,20,Fnarrating.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
