OL,3,GNEWSANHS psychiatrist swaps consulting
OL,4,Aroom for cinema
OL,5,
OL,6,FShergill said her passion for cinema
OL,7,Fbegan when her father, who still lives
OL,8,Fin her home city, introduced her to
OL,9,FSteven Spielberg's films at the age of
OL,10,Ffour.
